            "rect": [
                365,
                546,
                24,
                24
            ],
            "text": "Live desktop keeps the screen updating while you drag; close an open menu first. Screenshot first captures every monitor before the selector opens and cuts your region from that picture, so open menus and tooltips are included. Applies to new captures."
