            "kind": "button",
            "name": "recordingFrameRateHelp",
            "rect": [
                337,
                684,
                24,
                24
            ],
            "text": "Frames per second for new recordings. 60 looks smoother and takes about twice the work to convert and encode. When the computer can't keep up during a recording, put.gd lowers the rate for the rest of it (60 to 30, then 15) so the desktop you're recording stays responsive; the clip keeps its full length. Applies to new recordings."
        },
        {
            "class": "QComboBox",
